# ─── eggfleet-admin ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored) and adjust.

# Optional: absolute Nest API base **including** `/api/v1`.
# - Leave unset for `npm run dev` — Vite proxies `/api` → http://127.0.0.1:3000 (see vite.config.ts).
# - Required for `vite preview`, static hosting, or Cloudflare Tunnel to the SPA alone:
#   point this at wherever Nest is reachable (same host or public API URL).
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-api.example.com/api/v1
